WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.848
Think about the last event you walked
through. What made you stop?

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.681
It could be a tasting,

00:00:06.681 --> 00:00:10.490
a lounge where guests meet your team, or a
photo they want to keep.

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:15.407
VNV Events turns an approved sponsorship
brief

00:00:15.407 --> 00:00:17.395
into a live experience.

00:00:17.752 --> 00:00:20.074
We design the space, coordinate the build

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:23.312
and plan how guests move through it.

00:00:23.788 --> 00:00:26.740
We agree with the organizer and the brand
on staffing,

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:30.133
installation and what to document after the
event.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.948
Tell us who you want to reach and what you
want them to do.
